<description>&lt;p&gt;Colombian forces have launched a intensified offensive along the Venezuela border after a Venezuelan airstrike hit an ELN guerrilla camp, killing combatants and civilians. The government passed a law that removes political status from rebels, treating them as ordinary criminals, and tightened surrender terms for armed groups. The United Nations renewed its mission in Colombia while the United States reportedly took part in a bombing operation against the ELN in Venezuela. The war crimes tribunal JEP announced steep measures after a $53 million budget cut. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPVkQyTU5QLS1RV0N3SU1iekhjb2pIbmpEOGJOZUZYaFA2di1zVXdQa0RHNjRmODhJYWRPSVFfWlZXNmFvM2F1YVdydHNzaWZQRHVjOUJDTkt2VHhSQXgwNkdYdlZQVXlpWTJCNVRyZG1hLWdEdG9zdllaLS0zX0Z1UHhnaTF4TzY2Tkt3N1NlNkZvTjQyYk9zZl9OY1VWVmc1bFY4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxOYmJTMW1BMXg5NU1mSk1iMVBJNVhyQWx2ZTFZSGhDSnFVaE1Vb1NpdHluRXFCakdTVXhpV1NmeFkzT3hQVi0wazJZV2hUcExFbkd0TEcwSlV6SkNaTXVPS3JkYkRWaDhnY25nRUFZaEIwSjRxOFhST1VnbVM1LU5TNmRISnlRQ1RhZ2NHZnV2S3lhcEpZMjRYNk5GcGlMWDVXRWNXSWxkdDlXR0FVSkI5bDFLVkZmNkQxcnNlWFJRSERLR2R3MVFuYUdn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNVXFkb3ZKWi1pN0YtOThRQ2xCMmg2eFp3S3FQcFVEOGQ0dlVHSHdMS2lTNEZ2RG1VYnVUQ0ktbldkMGJjaE5NeHVRa0M2VHM0aWlwRERmUXZ4SXlSQXZ5Z1NKNzA3QUd1YVdjYm11eEJqWlJKaTI5U0QtLUVETExUbG96bjUzNkhxdTd6d0hUMWRSN1ZReFlva29veXFZVUVGWUdzMFJR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Colombia Reports&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNdGEyTGxXQTNRWi1XYjhWdXBrS3J6cTQxczFjNEdTY3RlcGI1OEtnam84Ui16RjJ4VkJUNjUxLUZuT1hQamltbTdVS2ExcTFGMzU1bXNDZXVyYXI1